              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "faq-h",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Common questions.",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "eyebrow": "Location FAQs"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "faq-list",
                  "type": "widget",
                  "props": {
                    "widget": "faq",
                    "config": {
                      "items": [
                        {
                          "q": "How many Rechtien Truck Group locations are there?",
                          "a": "Eleven. Five are in South Florida (Miami, Ft. Lauderdale, Riviera Beach, Fort Pierce and Fort Myers) and six are in South Carolina (Charleston, Columbia, Florence, Greer, Greenville and Conway)."
                        },
                        {
                          "q": "What are the sales and service hours in South Florida?",
                          "a": "Hours differ by location and department and are listed on each location card. At all five South Florida locations, sales and parts and service are open Monday to Friday, with parts and service starting at 7am; the cards show closing times and Saturday parts hours."
                        },
                        {
                          "q": "Do you offer Spanish-speaking service?",
                          "a": "Yes. Se habla español at our Miami and Ft. Lauderdale locations."
                        },
                        {
                          "q": "How do I contact a South Carolina location?",
                          "a": "Every South Carolina location lists its address and phone number on its card. Charleston, Columbia, Florence, Greer and Greenville also list a toll-free number; Conway lists a local number."
                        },
                        {
                          "q": "Do you offer service outside store hours?",
                          "a": "Yes. Idealease Mobile Service is available through Rechtien Truck Group in South Florida and South Carolina. Technicians come to your location during off hours or on weekends, for fleets of five or more commercial trucks."
                        },
                        {
                          "q": "How do I get directions to a location?",
                          "a": "Every location card has a Directions link that opens the address in Google Maps."
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
